# w69-rabblemaster: Goblin Rabblemaster's "at the beginning of combat on your turn" trigger goes on the
# stack when alice moves to combat, while bob (Full Control) holds priority, so it stays there as an
# ability chip. Forge's stack description for a phase trigger ends in "[Phase: <player>]" (the operator's
# Delver screenshot read "[Phase: Bella]") — the chip reads the ability's own text without it.
